WEBVTT

01:00:59.046 --> 01:01:04.585
might be hard to do from US to Africa
or China to Africa,

01:01:04.609 --> 01:01:06.244
might require to be local --

01:01:06.268 --> 01:01:10.204
those are the ones
that won't be taken by US and China.

01:01:10.228 --> 01:01:12.070
And lastly, I think,

01:01:12.094 --> 01:01:15.340
countries do have to look
at what is the next set

01:01:15.364 --> 01:01:20.617
of compassionate service aspect
that the country can go to.

01:01:20.641 --> 01:01:24.243
Maybe it is about becoming
a tourist destination,

01:01:24.267 --> 01:01:29.331
maybe it is about doing outsourcing
for nanny and elderly care.

01:01:29.355 --> 01:01:33.776
So a whole new set
of outsourcing will happen.